window.STORY_CHAPTERS["c22d4c3df3a5a914b"]={"id":"c22d4c3df3a5a914b","lines":[{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_9","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"不是祈求能离开游戏，而是祈求能通关。要靠自己的力量达成才行。","en":"My only Tanabata wish is to get out of this game. But that's a wish we have to grant ourselves.","ja":"願い事は出られますように、じゃなくクリアできますように、だね自分たちの力で成し遂げないと"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_10#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_10","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"不知道这个世界有没有海？虽然我讨厌大型怪物，但如果有美丽的沙滩，倒是想去看看。","en":"I wonder if Aincrad has beaches. If any of the shores are free of sea monsters, I'd love to go.","ja":"この世界にも海があるのかな大きい怪物とかはイヤだけど綺麗なビーチなら行ってみたいかも"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_11#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_11","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"今年没有放暑假的感觉呢，毕竟每天就是一直玩游戏。……虽然要赌上性命。","en":"I didn't feel like I was on vacation this summer. I spent the whole time in-game...fighting for my life.","ja":"今年は夏休みって感じはしなかったねやってることは一日中ゲームだし……命がけの、だけど"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_12#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_12","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"好久没有赏月了。总觉得这里的月亮比现实世界的漂亮……为什么呢？","en":"It's been ages since I've moongazed. It seems prettier than the real moon... I wonder why that is?","ja":"お月見なんて、久しぶりだわなんだか、現実で見た月より綺麗な気がする……なんでだろうね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_13#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_13","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"你不觉得穿上万圣节的扮装，可能会被误认成怪物吗？","en":"If we're in costume, don't you think we might get mistaken for monsters?","ja":"ハロウィンの仮装してるとモンスターに間違えられちゃいそうだと思わない?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_14#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_14","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"我一辈子都不会忘记这一天。如果能忘记，那就是有一天我能离开这里了……","en":"This date will always be a painful memory for me. If I'm ever able to forget it...it'll be if I ever escape.","ja":"この日のことは一生忘れられないもし忘れられるとしたらここから出られる日が来たら……ね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_15#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_sao_progre_15","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"我想至少在圣诞节这一天，可以抱着过节的心情享受一下。偶尔也是需要放松的嘛。","en":"I want to at least be festive on Christmas. It's important to recharge now and then.","ja":"クリスマスくらいは、お祭り気分で楽しんでもいいと思うたまにはリラックスも必要だもんね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"春天就是会让人想去有美丽花朵的地方呢，一方面也是想尽可能地感受季节变化。","en":"Spring always makes me want to go pick flowers. I want to experience the seasons as much as I can.","ja":"やっぱり春は、お花の綺麗な場所に行きたくなるね少しでも季節を感じたいし"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"虽然天气热就会想穿得薄一点，但如果要去《圈外》，就不能那样出门了……","en":"I want to dress lightly on hot days, but if we're going \"out of range,\" that's not such a good idea...","ja":"暑い日は薄着で出かけたいけど《圏外》に出るとなったらそうもいかないのよね……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"都说食欲之秋，不知道这个世界的蔬菜水果是不是也有季节性？","en":"Autumn is supposed to be a season for good eating, but is there even a harvest in this world?","ja":"食欲の秋って言うけどこの世界にも野菜や果物の旬って存在するのかしら"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"今天吐出的气变白色的了。明明就是在游戏里面啊，吓了我一跳。","en":"I could see my breath this morning. Freaked me out for a minute— you don't usually see that in games.","ja":"今日、吐いた息が白くなったのゲームの中なのにってびっくりしちゃった"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_bd_asuna_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_bd_asuna_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"谢谢你为我庆生。能够活着过生日……该怎么说，有种松一口气的感觉。","en":"Thanks. My birthday really hits different this year... I'm just relieved to still be alive.","ja":"誕生日、祝ってくれてありがとう生きて誕生日を迎えられて……なんていうか、ホッとした感じかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_bd_asuna_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_bd_asuna_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"今天是你生日吧？这个就当作送你的礼物吧。既然都知道了，不送就感觉很差。","en":"It's your birthday, right? Here. Present for you. I'd feel wrong not getting you anything.","ja":"今日、お誕生日なんでしょ一応コレ、プレゼント。知っちゃったからには、贈らないと気持ち悪いし"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"恭喜你升级，我也不能输给你呢。下次来帮忙我练功吧。","en":"Congratulations on leveling up. Looks like I've got some work to do. Help me level up, will you?","ja":"レベルアップおめでとうわたしも負けてられないな今度、レベル上げ手伝ってよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"你好像升级得很顺利呢。是不是找到了不错的练功区？跟我说，我请你吃饭！","en":"You're leveling up nicely. Did you find a good hunting spot? Take me there and dinner's on me!","ja":"レベルアップ順調みたいだねいい狩り場を見つけたのかな?教えてくれたら、ご飯奢るよ!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"不知不觉间，你好像变得很强了。没有把自己逼太紧吧？没问题吗？","en":"You've gotten much stronger while I wasn't looking. You okay? I hope you're not working too hard.","ja":"いつの間にか、ずいぶん強くなっちゃったみたいだね無理してない? 大丈夫?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"如果要认真以通过第100层为目标，至少得变得跟你一样强才行。……好，我也要努力！","en":"If I really want to clear the 100th floor, I'll need to get as strong as you... Okay. Let's get to work!","ja":"本気で100層クリアを目指すなら君くらい強くならないといけないね……よし、わたしも頑張る!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_asuna_sao_progre_5","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"如果能变得跟你一样强，肯定就能通关这个游戏了。希望你可以拉着我们往前迈进。","en":"If I get as strong as you, I'm sure I can clear this game. I wish you'd give us all a helpful push.","ja":"君くらい強くなれば、きっとこのゲームもクリアできるわたしたちを引っ張ってほしいな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"恭喜你完成任务！报酬有什么呢？","en":"Congrats on clearing the quest! So, what was your reward?","ja":"クエストクリア、おめでとう!報酬はどんな内容だったの?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"有礼物送来了耶。说应该要快点查看内容物的人可是你喔。","en":"You've got a gift. Better take your own advice and open it as soon as possible.","ja":"ギフトが届いているじゃない中身を早く確認すべきだって言ったのは君の方だよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"亚丝娜","en":"Asuna","ja":"アスナ"},"text":{"cn":"听说发现新任务了。如果你要接的话就一起挑战吧。两个人比一个人安全不是吗？","en":"I hear somebody found a new quest. We should check it out together. Safety in numbers, right?","ja":"新しいクエストが見つかったってやるなら一緒に挑戦しようよひとりよりふたりの方が安全でしょ?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"哥哥好像买了什么游戏机……那个游戏有那么好玩吗？","en":"My brother bought this new game... I wonder if it's any good.","ja":"兄さんが何かゲーム機を買っていたみたいだけど……そんなに面白いゲームなのかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"宫城的奶奶家被拆掉了。真想再去一次啊……","en":"My grandma's house in Miyagi got demolished. I wish I could have gone there one last time.","ja":"宮城のおばあちゃんの家取り壊されちゃったんだもう一度行きたかったなあ……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"……今天实在提不起劲做事。不过要是被妈妈听到这句话，她会骂我的。","en":"I'm just not motivated today... but don't tell Mom I said that. She'll give me an earful.","ja":"……今日は、やる気が出ないななんて、母さんに聞かれたら怒られちゃうけど"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"爸爸有一个叫做须乡的下属……虽然他态度温和人也很好，但我就是有点怕他。","en":"Mr. Sugo, this guy who works for my dad... He's really nice, but I just don't like him for some reason.","ja":"父さんの部下の須郷さんて人……物腰も柔らかいし優しいんだけどどうも苦手なのよね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_5","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"每天都只有念书和考试，等到考完高中，不知道这种生活会不会有点改变。","en":"Studying for high school is my entire existence right now. Will that change once I'm in high school?","ja":"受験勉強だけで毎日が終わる高校受験が終わったらこの生活も少しは変わるのかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_6","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"喜欢的人吗……恋爱话题虽然让人兴奋，不过跟我几乎无缘。","en":"It's really exciting hearing other people talk about their crushes... but it's definitely out of my league.","ja":"好きな人……かあ恋バナって盛り上がるけどわたしには縁遠い話よね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_7","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"就读一间好大学，然后进入一间好公司上班。这样我的人生肯定就会幸福了。","en":"My plan is, get into a good college, then get a good job. When that happens, I'll finally be happy.","ja":"いい大学に入って、いいところに就職する。そうすれば、きっとわたしの人生幸せになるんだよね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_8","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我喜欢京都，但是要跟本家的那些人见面……会让我心情有点沉重。","en":"I do love Kyoto, but I don't love the idea of seeing my relatives. It fills me with dread.","ja":"京都は好きだけど本家の人たちと会うのは……少しだけ気が重いの"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_asuna_real_junior_high_school_9","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"啊，不行，一不注意就发起呆了。我得赶快开始念下一个科目。","en":"Oh, shoot! I spaced out there... Next subject, next subject...","ja":"あっ、いけないついボーッとしちゃった早く次の科目に取りかからなきゃ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我喜欢保养头发的时间。虽然剪短的话保养起来也会比较轻松，但我想暂时维持这样。","en":"I love styling my hair. It would be easier if it were shorter, but I think I'll keep it long for a while.","ja":"髪の手入れをしている時間は好き短くすれば手入れも楽だけどしばらくはこのままがいいな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"呀！最近很少被摸头了，我会吓到的。","en":"Eek! Wow, you startled me. Nobody really touches my hair anymore.","ja":"きゃっ撫でられることなんて、最近はあんまりないから、びっくりしちゃう"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"虽然周遭也有朋友对化妆有兴趣，但我目前还好。等长大一点再说吧。","en":"Some of my friends are interested in makeup, but I'm not ready to go there yet. Maybe when I'm older.","ja":"お化粧に興味のある友だちもいるけど、わたしはまだいいかなもう少し大人になってから"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"……对女生做这种事情，实在令人无法苟同耶。","en":"Um...if you think it's okay to treat girls like that, there's something seriously wrong with you.","ja":"……女の子にそういうことするのって、どうかと思うよ?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_5","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"你再这样，我就要大叫了。","en":"If you do that again, I'll scream.","ja":"次やったら、大きな声出すから"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_6","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"最近好像有点瘦了。明明一直在念书都没有运动。","en":"I think I've lost some weight. Strange, since I've been so busy studying I haven't had time to exercise.","ja":"最近は少し痩せたかも勉強ばっかりで運動してないのに"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_7","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"不知道高中的制服可不可爱？其实我也想试试用制服来选高中……不过应该没办法吧。","en":"I hope my high school uniform is cute. A part of me wants to choose my high school based off the uniform...","ja":"高校の制服はかわいいかなあホントは制服で選んだりもしてみたいけど……無理だよね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_asuna_real_junior_high_school_8","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我之所以能维持现在的身材，或许是因为帮佣做的饭菜都很营养均衡吧。","en":"I owe my good physique in part to our cook, for giving me a balanced diet.","ja":"体型を維持できてるのはお手伝いさんがバランスのいい食事を作ってくれてるからかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我每天都在固定时间起床，所以早上会自然醒。","en":"I wake up at the same time every day, so my brain won't let me sleep in.","ja":"毎日決まった時間に起きてるから朝は自然と目が覚めちゃうの"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"早上没什么食欲，但是不吃的话妈妈会不高兴。","en":"I don't have an appetite in the morning, but my mom always yells at me if I skip breakfast.","ja":"朝はあんまり食欲ないけど食べないと母さんの機嫌が悪くなるのよね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"早上起来立刻念书已经彻底变成习惯了。不过，有时也想悠哉地睡下去呢。","en":"Studying first thing in the morning is a knee-jerk reaction to me. I wish I could sleep in sometimes.","ja":"朝起きてすぐに勉強するのもすっかり習慣になっちゃったでも、たまにはゆっくり寝てたいな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"在学校吃饭总是很热闹，跟在家里吃完全不同。在别人家里，这样才是常态吗？","en":"Meals at school are always so lively—completely unlike at home. Is everyone else's family different?","ja":"学校でのご飯は賑やかで家での食事とは大違いみんなの家では、これが普通なのかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_5","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"今天犯了好多粗心的错误，被老师骂了。我要再专心一点才行。","en":"My teacher yelled at me today for all my careless errors. I need to focus harder.","ja":"今日はケアレスミスが多くて先生に怒られちゃったもっと集中しないと"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_6","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"考试的日子就快到了。再确认一次测验范围好了。","en":"I have tests soon. I'd better go over all my notes again.","ja":"もうすぐ試験の日だもう一回、範囲を確認しておこう"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_7","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"哥哥和爸爸今天好像又会晚回家。晚饭又是我跟妈妈两个人吃了。","en":"My brother and father are coming home late tonight. That means I'm having dinner alone with Mom.","ja":"今日も兄さんと父さんは帰りが遅いみたい……晩ご飯はまた母さんとふたりっきりね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_8","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"今天有点累了。赶快把功课做完上床睡觉吧。","en":"I'm a little wiped out today. I'm just going to finish my homework and turn in early.","ja":"今日は少し疲れちゃったさっさと課題を終わらせて早めに寝ちゃおう"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_9","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"只有在洗澡时我才能放松，忘记念书或者将来的出路之类的事。","en":"Bath time is the one time of the day where I can forget about school and my future and just relax.","ja":"お風呂に入ってる時だけは勉強とか将来のことを忘れてゆっくりできるんだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_10#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_10","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"玩网络游戏的人都会熬到这么晚吗？有点难以置信……","en":"Wow, do gamers really stay up this late playing? It's a little hard to believe.","ja":"ネットゲームやってる人ってこんな時間まで遊んでるの?ちょっと信じられないな……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_11#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_11","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"……睡不着。怎么办，明天还是要跟平常一样早起啊。","en":"Uh-oh...I can't sleep. And I have to get up early tomorrow, too.","ja":"……眠れないどうしよう、明日もいつも通り早起きしなきゃいけないのに"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_12#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_asuna_real_junior_high_school_12","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"本来想说参考书念到一个段落再休息，结果不知不觉就这么晚了。","en":"I was going to do just one more page in the study guide...and now look at the time.","ja":"参考書のキリがいいところまでって思ってたら、いつの間にかこんな時間になっちゃった"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"星期一了啊。跟上礼拜一样的一周又要开始了。","en":"Oh. It's Monday. Another week just like the last.","ja":"月曜日かまた、先週と変わらない一週間が始まるのね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"上学虽然没有多开心，但我也不排斥。因为只要乖乖念书就不会被骂。","en":"School isn't much fun, but I don't mind it. As long as I'm studying, I don't get yelled at.","ja":"学校はそんなに楽しくもないけど別に嫌でもないわ。勉強してれば怒られることはないから"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"六日真想挑一天放假啊。不过，考试也快到了……不念书不行。","en":"I wish I could take either Saturdays or Sundays off. But I have to study for my high school entrance exams...","ja":"土日のどちらかはお休みしたいなでも、受験が近いし……やっぱり勉強しないとダメだね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"明天开始又要上学了。不过跟一直待在家里比起来，人在学校还可以转移一些注意力。","en":"Back to school tomorrow. But I actually feel a little more at ease there than I do at home.","ja":"明日からまた学校でも、ずっと家にいるよりは学校の方が少しは気が紛れるかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"新年快乐。今年……不知道有没有办法过得和以前不一样。","en":"Happy New Year! I hope that this year... is a bit different from the last.","ja":"あけましておめでとうございます今年は……去年までとは違う年にできるかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我很久没有在家里撒豆子了，说是打扫会很麻烦。","en":"I haven't done the Setsubun bean toss at home in years. My parents say it's a pain to clean up.","ja":"家の中で豆をまくなんてずいぶんやってないな掃除が面倒だからって言われて"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我没有送巧克力的对象。要很久以后才会有吧。","en":"I don't have anyone to give Valentine's chocolates to. And I know that's not changing anytime soon.","ja":"チョコレートあげる人なんていないわよそんなのはずっと先ね、きっと"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"小时候奶奶家都会帮我摆女儿节娃娃，那时候好开心啊……","en":"When I was little, my grandma and I decorated her house with dolls for Hinamatsuri. It was so much fun...","ja":"小さい頃は、おばあちゃん家でひな人形を飾ってもらってたな楽しかったな……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_5","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我明明没送巧克力，却还是有男生突然给我点心，真是伤脑筋。","en":"I didn't give any boys Valentines, but some of them gave me White Day gifts. It was really awkward...","ja":"チョコをあげてもいないのにいきなりお菓子渡してくる男子がいて困っちゃった"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_6","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我没有可以说谎捉弄的对象，所以今年也继续当一个诚实的人。","en":"I don't have anyone in my life who'd appreciate a practical joke. So it's Honest April again for me this year.","ja":"嘘をついてからかう相手なんてわたしにはいないからだから、今年も正直者よ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_7","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"连假正是提升学力的好机会！……这是照搬老师说的话啦。","en":"Spring Break is the best time to exercise your brain! Well...that's what my teachers say, at least.","ja":"連休こそ、学力を伸ばすチャンス!……なんて、先生の受け売りだけど"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_8","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"梅雨季好懒得去学校喔。如果能用VR上课就不用去学校了。","en":"Going to school in the rain is so bothersome. Can't we just go to class in VR?","ja":"梅雨の時期は、学校に行くのが億劫なの。VRで授業ができたら登校しなくてもいいのにな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_9","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"今年的愿望是希望顺利上榜。……去年也一样就是了。","en":"This year, I wish for a passing grade into a good high school... The same wish as last year.","ja":"今年の願いは合格祈願……去年も、同じだったけど"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_10#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_10","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"海边感觉很好玩，但是跟家人一起去也没意思……我看还是在家念书吧。","en":"The beach sounds fun, but the idea of going with my parents isn't. I'd rather stay home and study.","ja":"海って楽しそうだけど家族で行ってもなあ……やっぱり、家で勉強ね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_11#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_11","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"一等暑假结束，就会有考试即将到来的感觉。不能松懈啊。","en":"With summer ending, I feel my high school entrance exam on my heels. I have to stay sharp.","ja":"夏休みが終わると、いよいよ受験が迫ってるって気がする気が抜けないな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_12#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_12","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"赏月……偶尔也想看着月亮悠闲度过呢。","en":"Moon Viewing Festival... One of these years, I'd love to actually relax and celebrate it.","ja":"お月見……たまには、お月様を見ながらのんびりしたいな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_13#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_13","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"我没有在万圣节扮装过……感觉好像有点好玩。","en":"I've never dressed up for Halloween... but it does sound like fun.","ja":"ハロウィンの仮装ってやったことないけど……ちょっと面白そう"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_15#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_asuna_real_junior_high_school_15","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"……明年的圣诞节，我想跟朋友一起尽情狂欢。","en":"Next Christmas...I hope I can spend the day partying with my friends.","ja":"……来年のクリスマスは友だちとかと一緒に思いっきりはしゃぎたいな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"春天是许多事物会改变的季节……不知道我跟之前比起来，有没有稍微成长一点呢？","en":"Lots of changes happen in the spring...but I wonder if I've changed at all for the better?","ja":"春は色んなことが変わる季節だけど……わたしは、今までより少しは成長できてるのかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"夏天会因为出汗把笔记本弄湿，实在很麻烦……开冷气手脚又容易冰冷。","en":"I hate how I get sweat on my notes in the summer. I would use the AC, but then I'd get too cold.","ja":"夏は汗でノートが湿っちゃうからやっかいなのよね……エアコンを入れると、体が冷えちゃうし"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"这个季节，念书到晚上都会手脚冰冷。得来采取一些防寒措施了。","en":"My hands and feet always get cold at night in the fall. I need to get some fuzzy socks or something.","ja":"この季節は、夜まで勉強してると手足が冷えてくるの防寒対策、始めなくっちゃ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_asuna_real_junior_high_school_4","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"冬天到了。接下来是一连串的模拟考，可要小心不能把身体搞坏了。","en":"Winter came when I wasn't looking... which means I have to stay healthy for my high school entrance exams.","ja":"冬になっちゃったこれから模試の連続だから体調崩さないようにしないと"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_bd_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_bd_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"你要帮我庆生？……谢谢。我有点吃惊。","en":"You remembered my birthday? Wow, thanks... I'm kind of surprised.","ja":"お誕生日、祝ってくれるの?……ありがとうちょっと、びっくりしちゃった"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_real_junior_high_school_1","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"你今天也很努力，辛苦了。身体也要照顾好，早点睡觉喔。","en":"Good job out there today. Be sure to go to bed early and get your rest.","ja":"今日も頑張ったね、お疲れさまちゃんと早く寝て体調管理もしっかりね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_real_junior_high_school_2","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"好像是署名给你的礼物喔。呵呵，是谁送的呢？","en":"You've got a present. Hehe, I wonder who it's from?","ja":"あなた宛のプレゼントみたいよふふ、誰からなの?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_asuna_real_junior_high_school_3","speaker":{"cn":"明日奈","en":"Asuna","ja":"明日奈"},"text":{"cn":"任务……？我不太清楚是什么，但你应该知道吧？","en":"A quest? I don't really know what that is— do you?","ja":"クエスト……?わたしにはよくわからないけどあなたならわかるんじゃない?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"妳真的是新手吗？看妳使细剑的手法，完全不像是新手啊。","en":"Are you sure you're a noob? Hard to believe, from the way you swing that rapier.","ja":"君は本当に初心者なのか?そのレイピアさばきとかとても初心者には見えないよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"在MMO，最重要的就是知识。不知道正确的道理，危险性也会提高。","en":"In an MMO, knowledge is your most valuable asset. Getting lost can mean the difference between life and death.","ja":"MMOでは、何よりまず知識が大切なんだ。正しい道筋を知らないと危険も大きくなるから"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"有人马上就会换成强力的武器，也有人坚持用同样的武器，这部分因人而异。","en":"Some people switch to whatever is strongest and some get attached to their weapons. It takes all sorts.","ja":"すぐ強い武器に持ち替える奴もいるし同じ武器にこだわる奴もいるその辺りは、人それぞれだな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"要是没有生命危险，就更能欣赏这个世界的风景了。","en":"This game has some pretty nice scenery... Too bad we're too busy fighting for our lives to enjoy it.","ja":"命の危険さえなければこの世界の景色とかもっと楽しめたのになあ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_5","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"我认为地图数据是所有情报中最重要的，所以我不打算靠这个来赚钱。","en":"Info-wise, map data is the most important, hands down. So I wouldn't feel right selling it for profit.","ja":"マップデータは、情報の中でも一番大切だと思っている。だからこれで金を稼ぐ気はないんだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_6","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"找一个地方当据点会比较好吧？有个地方可以回去，感觉心情也会变得比较轻松。","en":"Having a home base is important. Just having a place to call home does wonders for your mood.","ja":"どこか一カ所、拠点を決めるといいんじゃないかな。帰る場所があると、なんか気持ちが楽になるし"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_7","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"虽然现在还没有，不过很快就会出现大型公会或团体。到时竞争也会变得激烈吧。","en":"I think eventually, some big guilds or parties will rise up. And when they do, the fighting's gonna get intense.","ja":"今はまだ存在しないけど、そのうち大きなギルドとかグループができるそうなると争いも熾烈になるんだよな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_8","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"不要只练剑技，搜敌和匿踪之类的技能最好也尽量提升。","en":"Don't just focus on your sword skills. You should make your stealth and tracking as high as possible, too.","ja":"ソードスキルだけじゃなくて索敵や隠密なんかのスキルもできるだけ上げておいた方がいいぞ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_kirito_sao_progre_9","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"……没事吧？如果累了，最好早点休息。还是妳饿了吗？","en":"Hey...are you okay? If you're tired, you should turn in early. Unless you're hungry?","ja":"……大丈夫か?疲れてるなら、早めに休んだ方がいいそれとも腹が減ったのか?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"其实我自己也很在意浏海。只是，也不知道在这个世界有没有办法剪头发……","en":"Yeah, I don't like how long my bangs are. But I'm not sure if hair cutting is a thing in this world.","ja":"前髪は自分でも気になってるんだよただ、この世界じゃ散髪できるかどうかもわからないしな……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"喂、喂喂，我的脸上有什么东西吗？是不是刚才吃面包沾到奶油……","en":"Wh-Whoa, there. Is there something on my face? I did just eat some cream puffs...","ja":"お、おいおい俺の顔になんかついてるか?さっき食べたパンのクリームかな……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"讲究头部装备的人很多喔。有人会绑头巾，还有人看起来好像头上长了角。","en":"Lots of players obsess over headgear. Some wear bandanas, and others like helmets with horns.","ja":"頭の装備にこだわる奴は多いぜバンダナ巻いてる奴とか角が生えてるように見える奴もいるな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"我是没有肌肉信仰，不过在战斗为主的游戏里，肌肉男看起来比较强也是事实。","en":"I'm not a muscular guy, but the ripped characters in fighting games do always look more menacing.","ja":"筋肉信仰は持ってないけどバトルメインのゲームだとマッチョが強そうに見えるのも事実だ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_5","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"突、突然被触碰身体，就算是男的也会吓一跳好吗？拜托要摸之前说一下。","en":"H-Hey, a little warning first? Don't think I'm used to this just because I'm a guy.","ja":"い、いきなり体を触られたら男だってびっくりするんだよ事前に予告してくれ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_6","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"等级低的铠甲外观果然也差强人意。真想要像样一点的装备啊。","en":"Low-level armor definitely looks pitiful. I really want something sturdier.","ja":"低レベル帯の鎧は、やっぱり見た目もイマイチなんだもう少しマシな装備が欲しいぜ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_7","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"嗯，叫我吗？如果妳没事做的话，要不要跟我一起去赚点珂尔？","en":"Oh, did you call me? If you're free, wanna go earn some cor with me?","ja":"ん、呼んだか?もし暇なんだったら、一緒に少しコルを稼ぎに行くか"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_touch_kirito_sao_progre_8","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"呃，那个……我不太习惯这样跟女生说话……","en":"W-Well, I'm just...not used to talking to girls like this.","ja":"い、いや……女性とこんな風に話すのは、あんまり慣れてないもんだからさ……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"要是养成晨练的习惯，不但早上起床会变得很轻松，对战斗也会有助益吧。","en":"Waking up early was easy when I exercised in the morning. Guess that old habit is helping me in battle now.","ja":"朝練の習慣をつけてれば朝起きるのも楽だったしバトルにも役立ったかもしれないなあ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"一早开始就不停玩游戏，如果不是在这种状况下，说真的应该是天堂才对。","en":"Truth be told, playing video games from sunup to sundown is actually my dream-job. Just...not like this.","ja":"朝からひたすらゲーム、なんて本当なら天国なんだけどなこんな状況でさえなければ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"妳一早就好有精神啊。我还想再睡一下，晚点再见吧。","en":"Gee, you sure are chipper this morning. I want to stay in bed a bit longer, so I'll see you later.","ja":"朝から元気だな俺はもう少し寝たいからまた後で会おう"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"我今天想去打一些强化材料。那边的怪物也会掉落细剑的强化材料，不嫌弃的话要不要一起来？","en":"I'm hunting for enhancement materials today. Wanna come with? They might drop rapier materials.","ja":"今日は強化素材を稼ごうと思うんだ細剣の強化素材もドロップするからイヤじゃなかったら一緒に行くか?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_5","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"这里的饭菜虽然也很好吃，但还是会想念酱油或味噌这些日式的调味啊。","en":"The food here is good, but I really miss Japanese flavors like soy sauce and miso.","ja":"ここのメシも美味いんだけどやっぱり醤油とか味噌とか和風の味付けが恋しくなるなあ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_6","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"一进旅馆就能看出已经有几个团体形成了。如果发现不错的人选，妳也去加入吧。","en":"When you're checking into inns, it's clear how many groups have formed. You should join one yourself.","ja":"宿屋に入ると、もういくつかのグループができてるのがわかる君もいい奴がいたら組むといい"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_7","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"一到晚上就能清楚看到星星。我明白这不是现实，但还是很漂亮。","en":"The stars are so bright here. I know they're not real, but they're still pretty.","ja":"夜になると星がよく見えるよなもちろん、現実じゃないのはわかってるけど、でもキレイだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_8","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"没想到会有跟女生单独吃晚饭的一天……没、没事，我什么都没说！","en":"Never thought I'd see the day where I'd eat dinner alone with a girl... N-Nothing! I didn't say anything.","ja":"女の子とふたりっきりで晩飯を食べる日が来るなんてな……い、いや、何にも言ってないぞ!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_9","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"就算没有匿踪技能，只要穿着黑衣，感觉晚上也能有一定的隐蔽效果。","en":"Even without the stealth skill, I'd be practically invisible at night with these black clothes.","ja":"隠密スキルがなくても黒い服を着れば、夜の間はある程度隠れられそうだよな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_10#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_10","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"游戏里满常有那种深夜才能买到的道具。不过现实中就很少有这种事。","en":"In gaming, there's a surprisingly high number of items you can buy only at night. Unlike IRL, though.","ja":"深夜だけ買えるアイテムとかゲームでは割とありがちなんだよ現実ではあまり見ないけどさ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_11#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_11","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"这种时间去散步吗？最好不要到《圈外》喔。如果要去的话，我陪妳。","en":"Out for a walk this late at night? Don't go \"out of range,\" okay? If you must go, at least let me go with you.","ja":"こんな時間に散歩か?《圏外》には出ない方がいいぞもし行くなら、俺も付き合うよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_12#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_kirito_sao_progre_12","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"这里的餐点明明都是虚拟的，但为什么深夜吃的饭菜会如此美味呢……","en":"This food is just data, really... so why does it taste so good when it's late at night?","ja":"ここでの食事は仮想のはずなのになんで深夜に食べるメシはこんなに美味いんだろうなあ……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_kirito_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_kirito_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"听到星期一这个词，就会反射性地精神紧绷啊。明明游戏里是不分日子的。","en":"When I hear the word Monday, I instinctively panic. It's silly, since days are meaningless in-game.","ja":"月曜日って言葉を聞くと反射的にちょっと身構えちゃうなゲーム内なら曜日は関係ないのに"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"我对学校没有太多感情，不过还是会怀念那段和平的时光。","en":"I was never much of a school-person, but even I'm starting to miss the mundane peace of it all.","ja":"学校にそんな思い入れはないけどそれでも、あの平和だった時間が懐かしくなるよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_kirito_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_kirito_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"虽然知道星期几根本没差，但是一到六日就会很有干劲。今天我要把任务解完！","en":"I know days have no meaning here, but weekends always get me pumped. Let's finish that quest!","ja":"関係ないってわかってても土日になるとやる気が出てくる今日はクエスト終わらせるぞ!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_kirito_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_kirito_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"就连在游戏里面，星期天晚上大家也都会安静下来。真是不可思议。","en":"Don't you think it's funny how everyone gets all quiet on Sunday night here? I mean, we're in a game.","ja":"ゲームの中でも、日曜の夜はみんな静かになるんだな不思議なもんだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"新年快乐。能在这一年攻略到什么程度，将是胜负的关键！","en":"Happy New Year! Let's push ourselves to see how far we can go this year!","ja":"あけましておめでとうこの一年で、どこまで進めるかそれが勝負だな!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"来，吃下跟年龄相同数量的豆子吧。虽然我们在游戏里面，不过这是感受上的问题。","en":"Let's eat our age in beans. I know it doesn't matter since we're in a game, but do it for morale.","ja":"ほら、年の数だけ豆食べようぜゲームの中だけど、こういうのは気持ちの問題だからさ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"情人节喔……感觉会有很多必须两人组队才能通过的任务。","en":"Valentine's Day, huh... There might be some quests that can only be cleared with a partner, you know.","ja":"バレンタインねえ……ペアじゃないとクリアできないクエストとかけっこうありそうなんだよな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"女儿节到了，商店有在卖甜酒应景喔。还满好喝的。","en":"Would you believe it? They're selling the amazake drink for Hinamatsuri! It's actually pretty good.","ja":"ひな祭りにちなんで甘酒が売り出されてるぞけっこう美味しかったよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_5","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"虽说是白色情人节，不过会有人要给谁回礼吗？情侣一起登录游戏的另当别论。","en":"Who even has a White Day gift to give? I guess if any couples logged in together, that's another story.","ja":"ホワイトデーっつってもまだそんなに貰った奴いないよな恋人同士で参加した奴らは別だが"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_6","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"今天是愚人节，所以肯定会有搞怪的头目出现。这类头目掉落的东西其实还不错喔。","en":"There'll probably be some silly boss today since it's April Fools'. And joke bosses actually have good drop rates.","ja":"エイプリルフールだからきっとふざけたボスが出現するぞこういうのは案外ドロップがいいんだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_7","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"黄金周……就算没有被关在这里，我肯定也是一整天都在玩游戏。","en":"If only we were free for Golden Week—oh, who am I kidding? I'd still be playing games all day.","ja":"ゴールデンウィークは……閉じ込められてなくても、きっと一日中ゲームしてたと思う"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_8","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"一下雨就懒得外出了。那个淋湿的感觉异常真实。","en":"It's always a drag to go out when it's raining. They got the sticky humid feel so realistic it's creepy.","ja":"雨が降ると、外出が億劫になるんだ濡れた感覚とかが変にリアルなんだよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_9","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"……希望到明年七夕都能平平安安，这样或许就能再一起观赏了。","en":"My Tanataba wish is just to survive until next Tanabata, I guess. Then we can stargaze together again.","ja":"……来年の七夕まで、なんとか無事にいられたらいいなそうしたら、また一緒に見られるかも"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_10#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_10","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"祭典的摊贩小吃为什么会那么好吃呢？啊啊，突然好想吃啊。","en":"Why is festival food so good? Argh, now I'm hungry.","ja":"お祭りの屋台料理って、なんであんなに美味しいんだろうなああ、食いたくなってきた"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_11#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_11","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"每年暑假的最后一天我都在赶作业。一口气把作业全部写完，某方面来说很有快感。","en":"I always put off summer homework until the last day of vacation. Finishing it all felt oddly satisfying.","ja":"夏休み最終日は、毎年宿題に追われてたよ。一気にババッと仕上げるのってある意味快感なんだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_12#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_12","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"赏月的日子里，好像会有兔子的怪物出现。听说牠的肉还满好吃的喔。","en":"They've got rabbit-monsters out for the Moon Viewing Festival. I hear they're actually pretty tasty.","ja":"お月見にちなんで、ウサギのモンスターが出現するらしいその肉は案外美味いらしいぞ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_13#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_13","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"我不需要糖果，有没有人会发强化材料呢？药剂或水晶类的也可以。","en":"Instead of candy, can somebody get me some enhancement materials? Potions or crystals work, too.","ja":"お菓子は要らないから誰か強化素材を配ってくれないかなポーションや結晶類でもいいけど"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_14#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_14","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"我到现在还是会梦到这一天的事。醒来后发现那原来是现实，然后感到绝望。","en":"I still have nightmares about that day. I'll wake up, realize it actually happened, and cry myself awake.","ja":"この日のことは、今でも夢に見るよ目が覚めて、現実だったんだって絶望するまでがセットだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_15#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_kirito_sao_progre_15","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"圣诞节总觉得情侣很多……明明女性玩家占比很低的说。","en":"I've been seeing a lot of couples this Christmas... Strange, since the boy-girl ratio here is ten to one.","ja":"クリスマスは、心なしかカップルが多い気がするんだ……女性率はかなり低いはずなのに"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_kirito_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_kirito_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"樱花的季节到了，如果要带着赏花便当去野餐……暂时无法有这样的闲情逸致吧。","en":"I love taking a picnic to the cherry blossoms in spring...but that's not happening anytime soon.","ja":"桜の季節だけど、お花見弁当持ってピクニック……なんていうのはしばらくできそうにないな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"热成这样，无法一直专注精神。要是不定期休息一下，感觉很容易不小心就失误了。","en":"I just can't focus when it's hot. I need to take breaks, otherwise I make a bunch of careless errors.","ja":"こうも暑いと、集中力が続かないな定期的に休憩取らないとうっかりミスをやっちゃいそうだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_kirito_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_kirito_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"这个世界应该也有记载了设置或故事的书籍。现在是读书之秋，我就去找找看吧。","en":"There must be books about Aincrad's settings and lore and such. Now that would make good autumn reading.","ja":"この世界にも、設定やら物語やらを書いた本があるはずなんだよな読書の秋だから、それを探してみるか"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_kirito_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_kirito_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"《SAO》连下雪的方式都很逼真。积雪之后感觉可以直接玩雪呢。","en":"Even the snow feels real in SAO. I wouldn't be surprised if we could play in it tomorrow.","ja":"《SAO》は、雪の降り方までリアルだよな。積もったらそのまま雪遊びができそうだ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_bd_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_bd_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"生日啊……在游戏里面总觉得没什么实感。不过我很高兴有妳的祝福。","en":"It's my...birthday? Doesn't feel like it when I'm stuck in this game. I'm glad you remembered, though.","ja":"誕生日か……ゲームの中だとなんだか実感がわかないな祝ってもらえるのはうれしいけど"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_bd_kirito_sao_progre_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_bd_kirito_sao_progre_6","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"今天是妳的生日对吧？……如果有什么想要的东西，我想买给妳。","en":"Today's your birthday, right? If there's anything you want... I wouldn't mind buying it for you.","ja":"今日は君の誕生日だったよな?……何か欲しいものがあるならよかったら買ってくるけど"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"恭喜妳升级。变强之后战斗方式也会改变，多方尝试看看吧。","en":"Congrats on leveling up. Your fighting style changes when you advance. Check it out!","ja":"レベルアップおめでとう強くなると戦い方も変わるからいろいろ試してみなよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"哦，已经升级了啊？妳的速度很快耶。我也要加油才行。","en":"Ooh, leveled up already? That was fast! I've got some catching up to do.","ja":"おっ、もうレベルアップかずいぶんペースが速いな俺も頑張らないと"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"我现在才发现，妳已经变得这么强了吗？老实说，超乎了我的想像。","en":"Wow, you got really powerful when I wasn't looking! More powerful than I could have imagined, to be honest.","ja":"気がついたら、もうそんなに強くなってたのか正直、予想以上だよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_4","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"妳好像变得非常强了，或许连我都赢不过妳……不，要赢我还早呢！","en":"You've gotten really strong... too strong for me to beat, maybe? No...I've still got some fight in me!","ja":"かなり強くなったみたいだな俺でも敵わないかも……いや、まだまだ負けないぜ!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_kirito_sao_progre_5","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"竟然把等级练到这么高，太佩服了。我知道妳一直很努力，我也真的很敬佩妳。","en":"Wow, did I didn't know levels went that high! Hats off to you. I know how hard you've worked for this.","ja":"そこまでレベルを上げるなんて脱帽だよ。ずっと努力してたのも知ってるし、本当に尊敬する"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_kirito_sao_progre_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_kirito_sao_progre_1","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"恭喜妳通过任务！这么一来，装备应该又更充实了吧？","en":"Congrats on clearing the quest! Are you going to win some more equipment?","ja":"クエストクリアおめでとう!これでまた、装備も充実するんじゃないか?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_kirito_sao_progre_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_kirito_sao_progre_2","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"礼物最好早点查看，说不定是意想不到的宝物喔。","en":"You should check your gifts ASAP. There might be something really valuable.","ja":"ギフトは早めに確認した方がいいぜ思わぬお宝が届いてるかもしれないからな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_kirito_sao_progre_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_kirito_sao_progre_3","speaker":{"cn":"桐人","en":"Kirito","ja":"キリト"},"text":{"cn":"新任务的情报出来了！这种的就是比看谁速度快。我们赶快去看看吧！","en":"A new quest just arrived! Come on, let's go check it out! The early bird catches the worm!","ja":"新クエストの情報が出たぞ!こういうのはスピード勝負ださっそく確認しに行こうぜ!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"在游戏世界里当偶像……好像做梦一样……而且百合子也在……","en":"An idol in a fantasy VR game... It feels like I'm dreaming. Especially with Yuriko here.","ja":"ゲームの世界で、アイドル……なんだか、夢みたい……百合子さんも、いるし"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"战斗也需要运动细胞……要是不稍微锻炼一下身体，说不定马上就会输掉……","en":"I need to be fit to fight. I'd better do some training exercises. I just hope I don't die right away...","ja":"戦うにも、運動神経が必要……だったら、ちょっと体を鍛えないとすぐにやられちゃう、かな……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_3","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"光是思考要优先提升哪项技能……似乎就能花掉一整天呢……","en":"Which skill should I raise first? Oh, this is stressing me out... I'll need a day to think...","ja":"どのスキルを優先的に上げるかそれを、考えているだけで……一日過ごせそう……です"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_4","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"在空中飞行真的很有趣……制作人先生要不要……也和杏奈一起飞上天试试呢……？","en":"Flying...it's so much fun. Um, sir? Would you, uh... like to fly...with me?","ja":"空を飛ぶのって、すごく楽しい……プロデューサーさんも杏奈と一緒に……飛んで……みる?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_5","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"如果有《偶像》这项技能的话……不知道杏奈的等级会是多少呢……？","en":"If \"idoling\" were a skill, what level do you think I'd be?","ja":"《アイドル》、っていうスキルがあったら……杏奈はどのくらいのレベル、かな……?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_6","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"不论天空还是森林……都好逼真……没想到竟然有这种游戏，杏奈到现在还觉得有些……难以置信。","en":"The sky and trees look so real... Even now, I find it hard to believe that games like this really exist.","ja":"空も、森も……ホンモノみたい……こんなゲームがあるなんて今でもちょっと信じられない……です"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_7","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"要是可以像这个世界一样，付出多少努力就能提升多少状态的话，或许杏奈也能好好加油……","en":"If I could raise my real life stats by studying, like in this world... I think I could actually make it.","ja":"この世界みたいに、勉強したぶんステータスが、上がれば……杏奈も、頑張れるかも……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_8","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"听说头目战需要众多队伍一起挑战……杏奈也好想参加看看喔。","en":"I hear boss fights are done in groups. Oh, gee, I'd love to join one...","ja":"ボス戦は、大勢のパーティーで挑むんだって……杏奈も、参加してみたい……な"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_anna_alo_9","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"……累了吗？杏奈也想稍微喘口气……一起休息吧……？","en":"Oh...are you tired, sir? Maybe I'll take a break, too. Do you...want to hang out with me?","ja":"……疲れ、ちゃったの?杏奈も、ちょっと休憩……一緒に……お休み、しよう?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"早、早安。一大早就泡在游戏里头……总觉得有股……小小的罪恶感呢。","en":"Good morning, sir. Look at me, already gaming so early in the day. I feel kind of...guilty.","ja":"おはよう、ございます朝から、ゲームの中なんて……ちょっと、罪悪感……です"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"一起……吃早餐吧……？在游戏里也要好好吃饭……不然会动不了喔……？","en":"Hey...want to eat breakfast with me? Even though we're in a game, we still need to eat to move, right?","ja":"朝ご飯……一緒に、食べよ……?ゲームの中でも、ちゃんと食べないと、動けない……よ?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_3","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"你今天会从早到晚……一直陪在杏奈身旁……？好高兴……谢谢你。","en":"Oh, wow, are you really going to spend the whole day with me? Thanks... That's so sweet of you.","ja":"今日は、朝から夜まで……ずっと、杏奈と一緒にいる……の?うれしい……ありがとう"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_4","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"有卖好多装备喔……果然还是要选……外观也很可爱的装备……","en":"They're selling all sorts of equipment. Well, if I'm going to buy something, the cuter the better...right?","ja":"色んな装備が、売ってる……やっぱり……見た目も、かわいい装備の方が、いい……よね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_5","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"从空中俯瞰的景色……真壮观呢……鸟儿也是这样的心情吗……","en":"Wow... Everything looks so different from up in the sky. I wonder... Is this how birds feel?","ja":"空の上からの、景色って……すごい、ね……鳥って、こんな気持ち……なのかな"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_6","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"真想跟百合子组队……一起攻略迷宫看看……","en":"I'd love to team up with Yuriko to raid a dungeon or something. That would be fun...","ja":"百合子さんと一緒に、パーティーを組んで……ダンジョン攻略とかやってみたい……です"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_7","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"杏奈一直很想……造访幻想世界中的酒场……现在愿望实现了。","en":"Wow, a fantasy world tavern... I've always wanted to go to one. Seems my dream came true.","ja":"ファンタジーの、酒場……一度、行ってみたかった……です願いが、かなっちゃい……ました"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_8","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"晚上有点恐怖……可是场景这么逼真……让人觉得有点开心……","en":"Night time...scares me a little. But...I also kinda like how realistic that is here.","ja":"夜は、少し怖い……ですでも、それがリアルで……なんだか、うれしい……です"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_9","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"远处有道……美丽的亮光……虽然有些可怕，但是……要不要一起过去看看？","en":"Look at that pretty light over there. Would you go check it out with me? I'm...scared to go alone.","ja":"遠くに……キレイな、光が……ちょっと怖いけど、一緒にあそこまで……行って、みる?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_10#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_10","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"能一起通宵玩游戏……杏奈总觉得心脏……扑通扑通地，越跳越快了。","en":"Oh, wow, look at us. Gaming together until morning... I feel so...funny inside.","ja":"朝まで、一緒に……ゲーム杏奈、なんだか……ドキドキして、きちゃいました"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_11#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_11","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"和你聊天很开心……不过差不多该睡了……晚安……","en":"I'm enjoying our conversation... but we'd better get to sleep. Goodnight, sir.","ja":"おしゃべりは、楽しいけど……そろそろ、寝ないと……ですおやすみ、なさい……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_12#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_anna_alo_12","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"在深夜散步……现实中……很难体验到呢……","en":"A late-night stroll... Now that's an experience I don't get to have in the real world.","ja":"深夜の、お散歩……だね現実では……あんまりできない、経験……です"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_anna_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_anna_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"星期一……在游戏中迎接一个礼拜的开始……总觉得……全身充满了干劲。","en":"Starting the week off with a game... I like it. It really gives me energy for the week.","ja":"月曜日……一週間の、最初がゲームの中から、スタート……なんてとっても、やる気が……出ます"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_anna_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_anna_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"如果学校也能……改在VR世界上课的话……说不定会很好玩……","en":"You know, if we held class in VR... it would probably be much more fun.","ja":"学校の、授業も……VRの中で、やってもらえたら楽しい……かも……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_anna_alo_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_anna_alo_3","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"假日可以跟制作人先生……一起待在游戏里……杏奈非常开心喔……♪","en":"A whole day of gaming together on my day off with you... I'm the luckiest idol alive♪","ja":"お休みの……日に、ゲームの中で……プロデューサーさんと一緒で……杏奈……すごく、うれしい……です♪"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_day_anna_alo_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_day_anna_alo_4","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"星期天晚上总会不小心熬夜……因为玩得很开心……","en":"I don't mean to, but... I always stay up too late on Sundays. I'm just having too much fun.","ja":"日曜日の夜は……いつも夜更かし、しちゃい……ます楽しい、から……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"新年快乐……今年也请多多指教……","en":"Happy...New Year. I hope you have a good one, sir.","ja":"あけまして、おめでと、です……今年もよろしく、お願い……します"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"吃下跟自己年纪一样数量的豆子……在VR世界中也会……有益健康吗……？","en":"We eat our age in beans for Setsubun. I wonder...does that have the same health benefits in VR?","ja":"年の数だけ、お豆を食べる……VRの中でも……健康に、効果があるの……かな……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_3","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"你……喜欢……巧克力吗？其实，杏奈有准备喔……锵～♪请收下……","en":"So, um...do you like chocolate? You see...I, um...have some for you. Ta-daaah♪ Happy Valentine's Day.","ja":"えと……チョコレート……好き?……実は、用意して……ある……じゃん……♪ どうぞ……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_4","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"今天是女孩子的节日……杏奈可以……撒娇……一下吗？","en":"Since today is Girls' Day... could you maybe... be extra-nice to me?","ja":"今日は、女の子の、お祝い……ちょっとだけ、甘えても……いい、ですか?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_5","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"给杏奈的白色情人节回礼……杏奈好高兴……谢谢你。","en":"Oh, wow... You got me a White Day gift? Thanks. That's so sweet.","ja":"杏奈に、ホワイトデーのお返し……うれしい……ありがとう……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_6","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"杏奈……老是在愚人节被骗，觉得很不甘心……所以今天请陪杏奈一起……想对策。","en":"I hate April Fools' Day. I always fall for the pranks. So...can you help me pull one on someone?","ja":"エイプリルフールは……いつも騙されちゃって、悔しい、から……今日は一緒に……考えて、ください"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_7","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"之前和百合子说好了……放连假的时候，要两个人一起玩游戏……","en":"Yuriko and I were talking... and we want to play this game during Golden Week vacation.","ja":"連休中は……百合子さんと一緒に、ゲームで遊ぼうってこの間……お話ししたんです"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_8","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"下雨了……但不会真的……淋湿所以淋到雨也没关系……","en":"It may be raining, but we don't actually get wet here. So... I kinda don't mind being out in it.","ja":"雨、だけど……実際に、濡れるわけじゃない……から濡れるのも、平気……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_9","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"这个世界的星星……真的好漂亮。感觉在这里，就能实现各种心愿……","en":"The stars are so pretty in this world. If I make a Tanabata wish here... I have a feeling it will come true.","ja":"この世界は、すごく……星が、きれいここでなら、きっと、色んな願い事が叶う……気がする"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_10#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_10","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"有听到祭典的声音……这个世界也有夏季祭典吗……？","en":"Listen...I can hear festival music. Do you think this world also has summer festivals?","ja":"お祭りの、音がする……この世界、にも……夏祭りが、あるのかな……?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_11#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_11","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"暑假……结束了呢……虽然寂寞，但过得很开心……所以明天开始也能继续努力……","en":"Summer vacation is almost over... I'm sad to see it end, but I'll carry my happy memories with me.","ja":"夏休み……終わっちゃう、ね……寂しいけど、楽しかった……から明日からも……頑張れる"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_12#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_12","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"这世界的月亮上……也有兔子吗……？要是能飞上去看看……就好了。","en":"Hey...do you think the moon in this world has rabbits living on it? I wish I could just fly there and see.","ja":"この世界の、お月様……にもウサギが、住んでる……かな空を、飛んで行けたら……いいのに"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_13#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_13","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"虽然不能恶作剧……不过好想吃甜点呢……可以的话，想和你一起……","en":"I'm not good at tricks...but I do love treats. Can I share my candy with you?","ja":"トリック、は……できないけどお菓子は、食べたい……ですできれば、一緒に……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_15#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_event_anna_alo_15","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"城镇中央有棵好～大的圣诞树……要不要……一起去看？","en":"There's a huge Christmas tree in the town square. Wanna go see it... with me?","ja":"おっきい、クリスマスツリーが街の真ん中に、あって……一緒に……見に、行く?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_anna_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_anna_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"一起……赏花吧？不管在游戏世界，还是现实……两边都想和你……一起去。","en":"Do you wanna have a picnic with me? In this world...or the real one... Either is fine with me.","ja":"お花見……行こう?この世界でも、現実、でも……どっちも、一緒に行きたい……な"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_anna_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_anna_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"因为可以放长假……很开心……所以杏奈很喜欢夏天……只是写作业好辛苦……","en":"I love summer vacation. It's nice and long, and so much fun. Though... I do hate the homework.","ja":"夏は……長いお休みが、あるから楽しくて、好き……宿題は……大変、だけど……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_anna_alo_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_anna_alo_3","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"秋天……是让人感到有些寂寞的季节……不过在游戏里就能见到远方的朋友……","en":"Autumn makes me feel melancholy... But when I game, I get to see my friends...even when they're far away.","ja":"秋は……少し、寂しい季節……だけどゲームの中、なら……遠くの友だちとも、会える……よね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_season_anna_alo_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_season_anna_alo_4","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"今天的风好冰……好冷喔……就算在游戏世界里，一样是待在屋子里最舒服呢……","en":"The winds are so bitter cold today... Even in-game, I just feel like shutting myself indoors all day.","ja":"今日は、風……冷たくてすごく、寒い……ゲームの中、でもお家が、一番……だね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"升级了……恭喜你。你接下来……也愿意和杏奈一起……冒险吗？","en":"Congrats on ranking up. Next time you go adventuring... can you take me with you?","ja":"ランクアップ……おめでとう次は……杏奈とも一緒に冒険……して、くれる?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"变得越来越强了呢……不久前才刚升级的说……","en":"Wow, you just keep getting stronger and stronger. Last time you ranked up wasn't that long ago...","ja":"どんどん……強く、なるねこの前、ランクアップしたばっかり、なのに……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_3","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"有了这实力……就能当上队长，带领大家了……","en":"You've become so strong now that... why, you could be our leader. Help us all reach our full potential.","ja":"この強さ、なら……リーダーになって……みんなを、引っ張れる……ね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_4","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"杏奈也不会输唷……因为杏奈想要……一直和你组队冒险……","en":"I'm working hard to keep up, okay? Because...I want to belong in your party forever.","ja":"杏奈も、負けてられない……ねだって……ずっと一緒に……パーティー、組んでいたい……から"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_rank_anna_alo_5","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"你已经登上顶点了呢……杏奈也要加油再加油……努力变强才行……","en":"Wow, you're a master now... Oh, gee...I'd better put my work in too.","ja":"極めちゃった……ね杏奈も、もっともっと……強く、ならないと……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_anna_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_anna_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"恭喜你完成使命……可以告诉杏奈……是什么样的……使命吗？","en":"Congrats on clearing the mission. So...what was it like? Can you give me any hints?","ja":"ミッションクリア……おめでとうどんなミッションだったのか……教えて……くれる?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_anna_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_anna_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"看过……礼物盒了吗？好像有什么东西送到了……赶快打开看看吧。","en":"So...did you check the Gift Box? I think you got something... Come on, let's open it.","ja":"ギフトボックス……見た?贈り物が、届いてる……みたい開けて、みようよ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_etc_anna_alo_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_etc_anna_alo_3","speaker":{"cn":"杏奈","en":"Anna","ja":"杏奈"},"text":{"cn":"新的任务开始……了一起去挑战吧……？一定会……很有趣的。","en":"So...a new quest has begun. Do you...wanna do it with me? Come on, it'll be fun.","ja":"新しいクエスト、始まった……ね一緒に、チャレンジ……しよう?きっと……楽しい、よ"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"没想到会闯进游戏世界……感觉就像平常看的小说突然变成现实一样！","en":"Oh, my goodness... I can't believe I'm in a VR world. It's just like my favorite books!","ja":"こんな世界に入ってしまうなんて……なんだか、いつも読んでいる小説が現実になったみたいです!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"这身装扮……怎么样？……咦？很适合我！？小心我喜欢上你喔！？","en":"So, is this a good look for me? Oh, it is?! W-Watch out, or I'll fall for you!","ja":"この格好……どうですか?……え? 似合ってる!?こ、恋しますよっ!?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_3#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_3","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"听说在这个世界里，可以一次叫出好几个画面，同时看很多本书耶！","en":"Hey, I hear that in this world, there's so many screens it's like you can read several novels at once!","ja":"この世界では、画面をたくさん出して同時に何冊も本を読むことができるみたいなんです!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_4#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_4","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"这个游戏似乎是改编自北欧神话。不知道众神会不会出场呢？","en":"This game is based off Norse mythology, apparently. Do you think we'll meet any Norse gods?","ja":"このゲームは、北欧神話がベースになっているみたいですね神様たちも出てくるんでしょうか"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_5#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_5","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"在VR世界中唱歌，感觉……有点不可思议。不过歌声可是货真价实的喔！","en":"Singing in a VR world... it feels kind of strange. But it definitely is my real voice!","ja":"VRの世界の中で歌うってなんだか……少し不思議な感じですでも、歌声は本物ですもんね!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_6#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_6","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"在这个世界里，我说不定也能成为真正的勇者！","en":"In this world, I really think I could finally become a real hero!","ja":"この世界だったら、私もついに本当の勇者になれるかもしれません!"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_7#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_7","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"刚开始的确吓了一跳……但我并不讨厌这个世界。而且大家都是好人。","en":"It was disorienting at first, but I actually really like this world. Everyone's so nice.","ja":"最初はビックリしましたけど……この世界、私はイヤじゃないですみんないい人ですし"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_8#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_8","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"只有自己一个人的话或许会很不安……还好小杏跟美希也在……","en":"If I were alone, I'd be scared right now. I'm so glad I have Miki and Anna with me here.","ja":"ひとりだったら、不安になってたかもしれないけど……杏奈ちゃんや美希さんが一緒でよかった……"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_9#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_wait_yuriko_alo_9","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"怎么了吗？是不是还不习惯VR世界，所以头晕了？","en":"What's wrong? Haven't got your \"sea legs\" yet in this new VR world?","ja":"どうしたんですか?もしかして、慣れないVRのせいで酔ってしまったんですか?"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_yuriko_alo_1#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_yuriko_alo_1","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"早安！……在游戏世界里还能睡觉跟起床，总觉得好有趣喔。","en":"Good morning, sir! ...It sure does feel funny to sleep and wake up in a game.","ja":"おはようございます!……ゲームの中で寝たり起きたりするのって、なんだか面白いですね"},"kind":"dialogue"},{"uid":"talk.vc.home_time_yuriko_alo_2#originalText","id":"talk.vc.home_time_yuriko_alo_2","speaker":{"cn":"百合子","en":"Yuriko","ja":"百合子"},"text":{"cn":"待在VR世界里的好处，就是早上的梳洗准备不会太麻烦。","en":"I love how in VR, the morning routine isn't as much of a drag.","ja":"VRの中だと、朝の準備があまり大変じゃないのがいいですね"},"kind":"dialogue"}]};
